s have to mean something when the strongest clubs are tested. Otherwise, what exactly are we asking everyone else to do? Celebrate being well run while accepting that the rules are optional for someone with deeper pockets? I don't buy that. And Klopp raising the question after winning the league makes it much harder to wave away as a complaint about losing.", "voice_id": "bu5eKETbFKC8G702EAU4", "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2"}